   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Comparatives of a word",
   "texto": [
    "The forms of a word we practice here - **больше**, **дороже**, **лучше** - do not change according to gender or number.",
    "**больше** (larger), **меньше** (smaller), **лучше** (better), **хуже** (worse), **дороже** (more expensive), **дешевле** (cheaper), **красивее** (more beautiful), **быстрее** (faster).",
    "To compare ages: **старше** (older; older) and **младше** (younger; younger)."
   ]
  },
